   "@id": "urn:claim-graphs:gadeke-2026-guilt-insula:hand:e_insula_voxel",
   "@type": [
    "cg:type/Evidence",
    "Evidence"
   ],
   "title": "A voxel-wise analysis found a small left anterior insula cluster responding more to the partner's low outcomes after participant than partner choices (peak T = 3.95, d = 0.59, 22 voxels), surviving small-volume correction (p = 0.024).",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Study 2 · Figure 4F. — Anchor: “We found a weak response in a small cluster within the left anterior insula (peak T = 3.95, d = 0.59, 22 voxels”"
   },
   "sourceDocument": "https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.105391.2",
   "observationBase": "https://iiif.elifesciences.org/epp/105391%2Fv2%2Fcontent%2F107300v6_fig4.tif/full/max,/0/default.jpg"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:claim-graphs:gadeke-2026-guilt-insula:hand:e_vs_model",
   "@type": [
    "cg:type/Check",
    "cg:type/Evidence",
    "Evidence"
   ],
   "title": "Ventral striatum activation increased with expected certain rewards and the expected values of chosen lotteries under the model-based regressor (left pFWE = 0.002, T = 5.63; right pFWE = 0.005, T = 5.46).",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Check. Study 2 · Figure 4G. Manipulation check for the model-based GLM before it is used to find the STS effect. — Anchor: “activation in bilateral ventral striatum indeed increased with the amount of expected certain rewards and the expected values of chosen lotteries”"
   },
   "sourceDocument": "https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.105391.2",
   "observationBase": "https://iiif.elifesciences.org/epp/105391%2Fv2%2Fcontent%2F107300v6_fig4.tif/full/max,/0/default.jpg"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:claim-graphs:gadeke-2026-guilt-insula:hand:e_sts",
   "@type": [
    "cg:type/Evidence",
    "Evidence"
   ],
   "title": "One left STS cluster responded more to the partner's reward prediction errors from participant than partner choices (pFWE = 0.022, T = 4.70, d = 0.53, 100 voxels, peak MNI [-52 -32 0]).",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Study 2 · Figure 4H. — Anchor: “We found this effect in one cluster within the left STS (pFWE = 0.022, T = 4.70, d = 0.53, Z = 4.57, 100 voxels”"
   },
   "sourceDocument": "https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.105391.2",
   "observationBase": "https://iiif.elifesciences.org/epp/105391%2Fv2%2Fcontent%2F107300v6_fig4.tif/full/max,/0/default.jpg"
  },
