   "@type": [
    "cg:type/Evidence",
    "Evidence"
   ],
   "title": "The STS cluster's responses to partner prediction errors from participant and partner choices are shown for both sessions.",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Study 2 · Figure 4I. — Anchor: “Responses to the computational-model-based regressors coding for partner reward prediction errors resulting from participant and from partner choices in this cluster are shown in Figure 4I”"
