   "@type": [
    "cg:type/Evidence",
    "Evidence"
   ],
   "title": "Right IFG connectivity with the left insula seed was highest for risky choices for oneself and safe choices for both players (pFWE = 0.020, T = 4.34, d = 0.80, 115 voxels).",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Study 2 · Figure 5. — Anchor: “pFWE = 0.020, T = 4.34, d = 0.80, Z = 4.21, 115 voxels, peak at MNI [46 16 22]; Figure 5”"
   },
   "sourceDocument": "https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.105391.2",
   "observationBase": "https://iiif.elifesciences.org/epp/105391%2Fv2%2Fcontent%2F107300v6_fig5.tif/full/max,/0/default.jpg"
