   "@type": [
    "cg:type/Evidence",
    "Evidence"
   ],
   "title": "Left IFG connectivity with the left STS seed showed the opposite pattern — highest for safe choices for oneself and risky choices for both — uncorrected (p = 0.001, T = 4.44, 35 voxels).",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Study 2 · Supplementary Figure 2. — Anchor: “connectivity was highest when participants made Safe choices for themselves and Risky choices for both players (puncorrected = 0.001, T = 4.44, Z = 4.30, 35 voxels”"
   },
   "sourceDocument": "https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.105391.2"
